    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110340" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαρμᾰκό-μαντις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ὁ, either <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one who is at once</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαρμακός</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάντις,</span> or <i>who uses</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάρμακα</span>
			<i>to divine from,</i> title of play by Anaxandrides.</div>
